<view class="page"
  ><view class="eyebrow">A GOOD DINNER, A BETTER EVERYDAY</view
  ><view class="heading">今天这顿，安排好了。</view
  ><view class="muted">少一点纠结，多一点家常的好滋味。</view
  ><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error" bindtap="load"
    >{{error}} · 点击重试</view
  ><block wx:if="{{d}}"
    ><view class="toolbar"
      ><view class="row"
        ><picker
          class="picker"
          range="{{servings}}"
          value="{{servingIndex}}"
          bindchange="serving"
          ><view>{{servings[servingIndex]}}人吃饭 ▾</view></picker
        ><picker
          class="picker"
          range="{{times}}"
          value="{{timeIndex}}"
          bindchange="time"
          ><view>{{times[timeIndex]}}分钟内 ▾</view></picker
        ><button class="button light small" disabled="{{busy}}" bindtap="save">
          更新偏好
        </button></view
      ><view class="row" style="margin-top: 18rpx"
        ><text class="caption">蛋奶素食</text
        ><switch
          checked="{{vegetarian}}"
          bindchange="vegetarian"
          color="#849c6d"
          style="
            transform: scale(0.75);
            transform-origin: right center;
          " /></view
    ></view>
    <view class="row section"
      ><text class="title">今晚，试试这道</text
      ><text class="link" bindtap="rotate">换一组 ↻</text></view
    ><view wx:if="{{!d.recommendations.length}}" class="empty"
      >当前偏好下没有可用菜谱，请增加准备时间或调整口味。</view
    ><view
      wx:for="{{d.recommendations}}"
      wx:key="id"
      wx:if="{{index === 0}}"
      class="card feature"
      ><view class="hero-art"
        ><image src="/assets/{{item.art}}.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
          class="row hero-badge"
          ><text class="pill"
            >{{d.pantry.length ? '参考已记录的食材' : '按用时与口味推荐'}}</text
          ><text class="caption">内部原型</text></view
        ></view
      ><view class="feature-body"
        ><view class="eyebrow">一顿家常饭的提案</view
        ><view class="recipe-title">{{item.title}}</view
        ><view class="muted">{{item.subtitle}}</view
        ><view class="meta"
          ><text>{{item.minutes}}分钟</text><text>{{item.servings}}人份</text
          ><text>{{item.vegetarian ? '蛋奶素食' : '家常荤菜'}}</text></view
        ><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="recipe"
          >完整做法，免费查看 →</text
        ><button
          class="button"
          data-id="{{item.id}}"
          disabled="{{busy}}"
          bindtap="plan"
        >
          就吃这道，加入今晚菜单 →
        </button></view
      ></view
    >
    <view class="section title">也可以换个口味</view
    ><view class="alt-grid"
      ><view
        wx:for="{{d.recommendations}}"
        wx:key="id"
        wx:if="{{index > 0}}"
        class="card alt"
        data-id="{{item.id}}"
        bindtap="recipe"
        ><image src="/assets/{{item.art}}.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
          class="alt-body"
          ><view class="title">{{item.title}}</view
          ><view class="meta"
            >{{item.minutes}}分钟 · {{item.servings}}人份</view
          ></view
        ></view
      ></view
    ><view class="caption section"
      >菜谱为原创开发稿，待人工烹饪校对。时间为估算，请检查食材并充分煮熟。</view
    >
    <view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">我的今晚菜单</text
        ><text class="pill">{{d.plans.length}}道</text></view
      ><view wx:if="{{!d.plans.length}}" class="empty"
        >挑一道喜欢的菜，今晚就有了安排。</view
      ><view wx:for="{{d.plans}}" wx:key="id" class="plan"
        ><view class="row"
          ><image src="/assets/{{item.recipe.art}}.png" mode="aspectFit" /><view
            class="plan-info"
            data-id="{{item.recipe_id}}"
            bindtap="recipe"
            ><view class="title">{{item.recipe.title}}</view
            ><view class="caption"
              >{{item.servings}}人份 · {{item.state === 'completed' ? '已完成' :
              '今晚待做'}}</view
            ></view
          ></view
        ><view
          wx:if="{{item.state === 'planned'}}"
          class="row"
          style="margin-top: 18rpx"
          ><button
            class="button light small"
            data-id="{{item.id}}"
            disabled="{{busy}}"
            bindtap="complete"
          >
            这顿做完了</button
          ><text class="link" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="remove"
            >移除菜单</text
          ></view
        ></view
      ><button
        wx:if="{{d.plans.length}}"
        class="button outline"
        bindtap="shopping"
      >
        查看今天的缺料清单 →
      </button></view
    >
    <view class="card"
      ><view class="row"
        ><text class="title">给日常留个印记</text
        ><text class="pill">连续{{d.user.streak}}天</text></view
      ><view class="week"
        ><view wx:for="{{d.user.week}}" wx:key="date" class="day"
          ><view class="day-dot {{item.signed ? 'signed' : ''}}"
            >{{item.signed ? '✓' : item.dayNumber}}</view
          ><text>{{item.label}}</text></view
        ></view
      ><button
        class="button light"
        disabled="{{busy || d.user.signedToday}}"
        bindtap="checkin"
      >
        {{d.user.signedToday ? '今日已签到' : '免费签到，记下今天'}}
      </button></view
    ><view class="card sage"
      ><view class="title">把手头的食材，<view>用在今天的餐桌上。</view></view
      ><view class="muted section">录入真实库存，让下一顿饭更好安排。</view
      ><button class="button outline" bindtap="pantry">
        打开食材冰箱 →
      </button></view
    ></block
  ><view class="footer">晚饭有谱 · 好好吃饭，慢慢生活</view></view
>
